                    \-quantity” was a misnomer. It should be “
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
                    \-quantity”. To explain (to myself) why, I created the dual entry
                    = succeed "." do
